# Living backend notes

When explaining architecture, naming, layers, REST, validation, or reviewing backend structure:

1. Follow the personal skill `backend-learning-reference`.
2. Update `BACKEND-REFERENCE.md` (repo root) in the same turn as the explanation.
3. Also update `~/.cursor/skills/backend-learning-reference/BACKEND-REFERENCE.md` so notes survive this repo.

Do not duplicate `LEARNING.md` (short practice log) or `CHANGELOG.md` (shipped API). This file is the long-term mindset notebook (concepts, side notes, drafts).
